          </span>
          <h2>Built on a Simple Promise: Warmth & Safety When You Need It Most</h2>
          <p>{{ site.BRAND }} was established with a singular mission — ensure no family or business is left in the dangerous cold during freezing weather. We recognize how critical, stressful, and hazardous a heating breakdown can be in the dead of winter, and we built the fastest dispatch network to solve it.</p>
          <p>We enforce a rigorous verification standard so every technician in our network is licensed, bonded, insured, and certified with major furnace manufacturers. Rather than generic listings, our network mobilizes certified heating contractors operating fully stocked mobile service vans with igniters, blower motors, pressure switches, and gas valves ready on the first trip.</p>
          <p>Today, {{ site.BRAND }} has assisted over 500,000 customers across all 50 states with everything from midnight gas furnace ignition repairs and cracked heat exchanger replacements to complete high-efficiency heat pump and commercial rooftop heating installations.</p>
        </div>
